{{apichanges|3.4.0|prev=2.5.4|next=3.4.1}}

==Summary==
* The client has pulled in a subset of API changes from [[Patch 9.2.5/API changes|Patch 9.2.5]]. This includes various breaking changes around the UnitPopup menu system.
* The client now supports a new <span class="apitype">_Wrath</span> suffix for loading [[TOC_format#Multiple_client_flavors|client-specific TOC files]]. An alternative suffix of <span class="apitype">-WOTLKC</span> is also supported for consistency with other legacy TOC suffixes.
* {{api|UnitAura}} has gained an additional return value (<code>shouldConsolidate</code>) immediately before the variable returns.
* The {{api|CURSOR_UPDATE|t=e}} event has been replaced by {{api|CURSOR_CHANGED|t=e}}.

==Resources==
* TOC: <code>30400</code>
* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/2.5.4..3.4.0 wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/compare/2.5.4..3.4.0 BlizzardInterfaceResources]

